[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4320.87, "timestamp": "01:12:00", "text": "方式。没关系。没关系。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4324.87, "timestamp": "01:12:04", "text": "好的。所以，嗯，我不知道为什么会这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4336.07, "timestamp": "01:12:16", "text": "嗯，有时候好像是这样，对吧？它崩溃了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.43, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "每当有新消息时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4341.43, "timestamp": "01:12:21", "text": "原因。是的。 Yama，如果你仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4343.75, "timestamp": "01:12:23", "text": "你能打个“嗨”之类的字吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4347.43, "timestamp": "01:12:27", "text": "还是别的什么？就像一点点，就一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4350.99, "timestamp": "01:12:30", "text": "或者两行之类的，直到我修复为止。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4355.59, "timestamp": "01:12:35", "text": "这。好的，它说了声“你好”，然后就崩溃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4359.669, "timestamp": "01:12:39", "text": "不，我需要手动编辑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4363.669, "timestamp": "01:12:43", "text": "文件。我的天哪。你好。你好。我会这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4369.59, "timestamp": "01:12:49", "text": "嗯，已经过去一段时间了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4374.47, "timestamp": "01:12:54", "text": "因为是直播，所以我认为应该不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4375.63, "timestamp": "01:12:55", "text": "片刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4377.79, "timestamp": "01:12:57", "text": "你做什么"}]